+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured on a 5,000-record store:
+
+| Health-gate implementation | SessionStart p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Before: `PRAGMA quick_check` ran on the read path | 11.9 ms |
+| After: `quick_check` was moved off the read path, the trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter was added, and the body `CHECK` constraint was added | 1.05 ms |
+
+The after measurement covers those three changes landing together. It does not
+isolate the contribution of `quick_check`, `fts_rows`, or the body constraint.
